  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency agriculture intervention response to affected farming households by Tropical Cyclone CHIDO in Cabo Delgado and Nampula provinces</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increase access to quality agricultural inputs for rainfed crop production to 17 500 of the hardest hit households in Cabo Delgado and Nampula provinces, with the aim of supporting agricultural recovery during the main farming season.
Enhance household nutrition and income diversification through the cultivation of horticultural crops for the same unique beneficiaries who have access to irrigation water</narrative>
  </description>
